# 3. SECURITY AND AUTHORIZATION MODEL

This platform is a **defensive security and threat-intelligence system**.

Implement strong operational controls.

The Internet scanning subsystem must distinguish between:

### MODE A — Owned Asset Scanning

Targets explicitly owned or controlled by the organization.

### MODE B — Customer Authorized Scanning

Customer-provided assets where explicit authorization is recorded.

### MODE C — Research / Internet Measurement

Only enabled for appropriately authorized and governed Internet measurement activity.

### MODE D — Internal Infrastructure

Private RFC1918 / RFC6598 / internal networks where explicitly authorized.

Do not assume that authentication inside Qguard Sentinel itself constitutes authorization to scan arbitrary third-party infrastructure.

Every scan must have:

```text
