The Internet Intelligence scanning plane must be **observation-first**.

It must not:

- exploit vulnerabilities,
- brute-force credentials,
- attempt password guessing,
- bypass authentication,
- establish authenticated sessions,
- deploy payloads,
- execute arbitrary remote code,
- weaponize discovered vulnerabilities,
- attempt privilege escalation,
- attempt credential theft,
- perform destructive actions,
- evade security controls,
