The service-intelligence layer should collect information available through normal unauthenticated protocol interaction.

Do not turn ZGrab2 into an exploit framework.

The ZGrab2 project itself explicitly separates its application-layer measurements from authentication, exploitation, and brute-force behavior.

The Internet Intelligence engine must follow the same principle.

